# Team skills: one directory per skill (<skill-name>/SKILL.md), each file
# listed in spec.yaml files[]. This placeholder stands in for them. Once a real
# skill is added, delete this file AND its files[] record in spec.yaml.
#
# It is deliberately NOT empty: as of acq v3.1.0 the msb adapter verifies a
# dropped file with `test -s`, so an empty payload never counts as delivered,
# and a failed drop aborts the rest of that kit's apply (environment and
# commands included).
